### Obtaining the global omega estimate based on relative GTR branch lengths and nucleotide substitution biases
* Log(L) = -11405.74, AIC-c = 23930.93 (557 estimated parameters)
* 1 partition. Total tree length by partition (subs/site)  1.409
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio for *test* =   0.4890

### Fitting Standard MG94
* Log(L) = -10909.04, AIC-c = 22947.62 (562 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.4746
