### Fitting MG94 with double instantaneous substitutions
* Log(L) = -10893.07, AIC-c = 22917.70 (563 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.4612
* rate at which 2 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.0601
