### Fitting MG94 with double and triple instantaneous substitutions
* Log(L) = -10893.02, AIC-c = 22919.61 (564 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.4590
* rate at which 2 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.0596
* rate at which 3 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.0093
* rate at which 3 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon between synonymous codon islands =   0.0093
* The following relative rate distribution (mean 1) for site-to-site **non-synonymous** rate variation was inferred

|               Rate                | Proportion, % |               Notes               |
|-----------------------------------|---------------|-----------------------------------|
|               0.216               |    73.245     |                                   |
